<title>USA: Cityscape Financial issues $300 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Cityscape Financial issues $300 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A debt issue from Cityscape Financial Corp was priced on Friday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>Cityscape Financial is a consumer finance company that specializes in home equity mortgage loans in the U.S. and the United Kingdom.</p>
<p>CIBC Wood Gundy Securities Corp was the lead manager.</p>
<p>BORROWER CITYSCAPE FINANCIAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 12.75 PCT  MATURITY 6/01/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 12/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 12.75 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 606 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTE: Three year equity call for 1/3 issue at par plus coupon</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
</text>
